# Normalize line endings on commit. The mechanical gates are POSIX shell
# pipelines, and a stray \r at the end of an extracted ID makes `comm`
# report every ID as unmatched — silently, which is the worst kind.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Shell scripts must be LF even on a Windows checkout, or bash refuses them
# with "bad interpreter: /usr/bin/env bash^M: no such file or directory".
*.sh text eol=lf

# Binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
